CryptoCell SHA-256 adaptation

src/crypto.rs adapts the CryptoCell SHA-256 register sequence from
OpenSK bootloader/src/crypto_cell.rs, revision
5e30a47bc3ea1f664c9e6845b146ce88980bddfd:
https://github.com/google/OpenSK/blob/5e30a47bc3ea1f664c9e6845b146ce88980bddfd/bootloader/src/crypto_cell.rs
Copyright 2019-2022 Google LLC. Apache License, Version 2.0.
The original implementation identifies Jean-Michel Picod as its author.
Changes include direct MMIO, bounded polling, one-shot hashing and shared
RAM scratch. The upstream-derived portion retains Apache-2.0; original port
integration remains within the scope above. The Apache-2.0 text is provided
in the repository root LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.
